  "_changes": [
    "wave 22 kit-polish: core gained ids cfk-core-prefix-enabled, cfk-core-delete-trigger and cfk-core-timezone (its two switches and the timezone select had no id, so their labels did not toggle or focus them); the settings search now finds them too.",
